	(text "Keep SYS at 4.5 V when USB powered.\nMODE low selects power-save operation.\nFeedback: 511k / 91k; nominal output 3.308 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
